= Instructions

Add the @Disaronno Amaretto{1 1/2 oz}, @Glenfiddich 14 Year Bourbon Barrel{3/4 oz}, @Fresh Lemon Juice{3/4 oz},
@Simple Syrup{1/2 oz}, @Fresh Double Espresso (Cooled){2 oz}, @Coffee bitters{2 dashes},
and @Fee Brothers Vegan Foamer{8-10 drops} to a #Cocktail shaker{}.

Dry shake for ~{15 seconds}.

Add @Ice{} and shake hard for another ~{15 seconds}.

Double strain over a large clear @Ice{} cube in a #Rocks glass{}.

Add a few drops of @Coffee bitters{} to the foam, then drag a toothpick through the drops to create a connected swirl pattern.